window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Tessa will never again see her mate.</b></p> <p>Even in her dreams, she cannot find him. Trapped in a vow with the God of Death, she's cursed to live the rest of her days in captivity.</p> <p>Until the gods offer her a deal. If Tessa undergoes a series of trials designed to strip her of her humanity, Andromeda will release her from the vow. If she refuses, pestilence and famine will consume Dubnos until no one is left alive.</p> <p>Tessa is forced to play their wicked game. She'll do whatever it takes to reunite with Kalen, even if it means embracing the darkness inside her.</p> <p>The fate of the world hangs in the balance. And if the knife's edge breaks, death will reign.</p> <p><i>Of Dust and Stars </i>is the epic conclusion to The Mist King series.</p>"; 
